invariant: INV-22
file: quic.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh quic_driver
reason: ch_quic_open opens a 1-RTT packet before the handshake completes,
  which RFC 9001 section 5.7 forbids a client. The quic_driver harness
  opens a packet that holds a header protection sample, at any level and
  over any saved state, and requires that a 1-RTT packet opens only in a
  connected session.

--- old
    if (level == CH_LEVEL_APPLICATION && q->t.state != CH_ST_CONNECTED) {
--- new
    if (0) {
